{"id":31,"titleZh":"向西贝柳斯致敬","titleEn":"A Tribute to Sibelius","date":"1965-02-19","dateZh":"1965 年 2 月 19 日","concepts":"民族独立精神、三音阶线索、动机跨乐章变形","thesis":"西贝柳斯的第二交响曲像一部严谨的侦探推理——第一页只埋下三个相邻音阶的小线索，一路乔装穿过四个乐章才亮出完整答案。","plain":"值此芬兰大师西贝柳斯百年诞辰，伯恩斯坦先用《芬兰颂》说明音乐比口号更有反抗力——尽管全曲没直接照抄一首民歌，却句句长在芬兰语调里。更绝的是《第二交响曲》严谨的线索埋伏：最温柔与最狂暴的乐段都从最初 3 个相邻音变出。","scenes":["以《芬兰颂》与临时破格提拔的 20 岁小提琴家塞尔吉乌·卢卡合作《小提琴协奏曲》开篇；随后专门用《第二交响曲》展开现场“线索追踪”。","先让圆号和双簧管分别吹出光秃秃的上行与下行三音阶动机，再播第三乐章风暴般快速狂吼的弦乐；伯恩斯坦先停下清唱慢速原型再立刻重播 10 秒快速风暴，让孩子瞬间听出同一线索如何完成伪装，最后见证它冲破小调迎来终曲大调胜利。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1k4411r7EL","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1k4411r7EL","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 致敬西贝柳斯","duration":"53:05","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/a-tribute-to-sibelius","repertoire":[{"composer":"Sibelius","piece":"Finlandia, Op. 26","titleZh":"芬兰颂","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview115/v4/4e/dc/68/4edc687f-963b-88e9-bf8b-591edacc3349/mzaf_5882264013049595877.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/finlandia-op-26/993550370?i=993550381&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"Finlandia, Op. 26","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sibelius%20Finlandia%2C%20Op.%2026+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Sibelius%20Finlandia%2C%20Op.%2026"},{"composer":"Sibelius","piece":"Violin Concerto in D Minor, Op. 47 (1st Movement)","titleZh":"d 小调小提琴协奏曲第一乐章","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/36/4c/58/364c5822-d41d-345b-5e1a-b1251d265155/mzaf_17931484461909577109.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/violin-concerto-in-d-minor-op-47-adagio-di-molto/458436919?i=458436985&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Jascha Heifetz, Walter Hendl & Chicago Symphony Orchestra","recordingTrack":"Violin Concerto in D Min